WEBVTT

00:05.480 --> 00:07.920
We can't prét? Why?!

00:07.920 --> 00:12.090
Himeno, you'll never be the Prétear again!

00:12.090 --> 00:14.030
Even if you want to be so in your heart,

00:14.030 --> 00:17.320
...deep within your heart, you don't want to fight!

00:19.260 --> 00:24.200
Now, Princess of Sorrow, feel the wrath of darkness!

00:25.440 --> 00:27.740
Please stop, Takako!

00:27.890 --> 00:31.160
The boundless future stretches across the skies

00:27.890 --> 00:31.160
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

00:31.160 --> 00:35.200
And I am reborn anew

00:31.160 --> 00:35.200
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

00:35.200 --> 00:42.220
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

00:35.200 --> 00:42.220
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

00:46.400 --> 00:46.600
Prétear

00:54.450 --> 01:01.360
Destiny is there to be grasped, so stretch out your hands

00:54.450 --> 01:01.360
unmei wa tsukamu mono kono te jiyuu ni nobaseba ii

01:01.360 --> 01:06.150
There is no tomorrow which has already been decided

01:01.360 --> 01:06.150
kimerareta ashita wa nai

01:08.200 --> 01:15.100
Even if you say nothing, I know our meeting that day was no coincidence

01:08.200 --> 01:15.100
damatte ite mo wakaru ano hi deai wa guuzen janai

01:15.100 --> 01:20.010
I sensed eternity in your distant gaze

01:15.100 --> 01:20.010
tooi hitomi ni eien kanjita

01:21.840 --> 01:25.710
The light of the setting sun is beautiful

01:21.840 --> 01:25.710
kurete yuku yuuhi ga kirei

01:25.710 --> 01:28.850
If the cold wind glimmers

01:25.710 --> 01:28.850
tsumetai kaze ga hikareba

01:28.850 --> 01:34.620
I can hear your voice drifting gently

01:28.850 --> 01:34.620
anata no koe sotto kikoeteru

01:34.790 --> 01:35.090
Knowing that I'm not alone in my heart

01:34.790 --> 01:39.560
kokoro no naka hitori janai koto itai hodo

01:39.560 --> 01:42.100
Warms it so much that it hurts

01:39.560 --> 01:42.100
kono mune o atsuku suru

01:42.100 --> 01:44.830
It all begins from the point of believing

01:42.100 --> 01:44.830
hajimaru ne shinjiru koto kara

01:44.830 --> 01:48.500
These feelings are proof of being alive

01:44.830 --> 01:48.500
kono kimochi ikiru akashi

01:48.500 --> 01:48.800
The endless future and the expanding skies

01:48.500 --> 01:51.710
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

01:51.710 --> 01:55.740
Allow me to be reborn anew

01:51.710 --> 01:55.740
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

01:55.740 --> 02:01.850
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

01:55.740 --> 02:01.850
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

02:01.850 --> 02:06.450
Holding hands with you

02:01.850 --> 02:08.450
sono te tsunaide

02:08.610 --> 02:11.940
Moment of Awakening

02:13.780 --> 02:14.540
Takako!

02:19.820 --> 02:20.880
Himeno!

02:29.030 --> 02:30.090
Sasame!

02:33.030 --> 02:35.020
The Knights are getting beaten.

02:35.670 --> 02:38.100
It's all because of the good-for-nothing Prétear.

02:43.480 --> 02:44.440
Himeno...

02:48.610 --> 02:49.920
I can't...

02:52.780 --> 02:55.390
What a pathetic girl.

02:55.390 --> 02:56.150
Stop it!

02:57.990 --> 02:59.620
Takako, enough already.

02:59.620 --> 03:01.430
Sasame, don't get in my way.

03:01.430 --> 03:05.760
No matter how much you hurt others, the wounds in your heart won't heal.

03:05.760 --> 03:06.920
Oh, really?

03:14.140 --> 03:15.330
Stop!

03:18.540 --> 03:20.370
Stop already!

03:35.130 --> 03:39.660
Himeno, I'm going to show you how powerless and burdensome you are.

03:39.660 --> 03:42.530
I'll show you nice and slow.

04:04.490 --> 04:08.130
It would have been very dangerous if a little more Leafe was taken.

04:08.130 --> 04:10.530
Yeah, he might have faded away.

04:11.460 --> 04:12.620
Sorry...

04:14.070 --> 04:14.770
Well...

04:14.770 --> 04:17.740
It's my fault, because I couldn't prét.

04:18.800 --> 04:20.360
Sasame was...

04:22.170 --> 04:24.330
It's not your fault.

04:25.280 --> 04:27.410
Himeno, get some rest already.

04:27.410 --> 04:30.040
Yeah, yeah, you're probably just tired today.

04:32.880 --> 04:35.790
Himeno, will you really be all right alone?

04:35.790 --> 04:37.260
Yeah, I'll be all right.

04:37.260 --> 04:38.660
Please feel better.

04:38.660 --> 04:39.820
Thanks.

05:01.280 --> 05:02.880
I want to meet him.

05:02.880 --> 05:04.280
I want to meet him, I want to...

05:04.280 --> 05:07.520
<i>Good evening. Tonight's "Sasame's Words Gate"...</i>

05:07.520 --> 05:10.580
<i>...will have its contents changed due to Sasame's sudden illness.</i>

05:12.320 --> 05:17.830
<i>We'll go through the most popular episodes of the past and broadcast the best selection...</i>

05:15.960 --> 05:17.830
It's my fault.

05:17.830 --> 05:21.630
Mom, I know this is no way to be.

05:23.540 --> 05:25.830
I do think so, but...

05:27.670 --> 05:30.270
Maybe I can't do anything anymore.

05:41.320 --> 05:46.220
This time, I'll brush the teeth of Miss Sleepyhead,

05:46.220 --> 05:51.030
...using the Mayune special ultra hyper hot spicy toothpaste!

05:51.030 --> 05:52.830
What? She's not here.

05:54.670 --> 05:55.370
Tanaka!

05:55.370 --> 05:57.330
Yes? What is it...

06:12.580 --> 06:14.550
Toothpaste makes things sparkle!

06:14.550 --> 06:17.620
See what I mean?! Look at the clear reflection of my face!

06:15.450 --> 06:18.250
Miss Mayune? What are you...

06:18.420 --> 06:20.830
Mikage! Himeno doesn't seem to be around!

06:20.830 --> 06:21.930
Do you know where she is?

06:21.930 --> 06:25.230
Miss Himeno seems to have departed early in the morning.

06:25.230 --> 06:26.860
Say what?!

06:28.730 --> 06:30.140
This is strange!

06:30.140 --> 06:34.070
How dare she make me go on a wild goose chase?! Unforgiveable!

06:34.070 --> 06:35.070
Wild goose chase?

06:35.070 --> 06:36.370
Never mind that!

06:36.370 --> 06:38.510
Her bag's been left behind! Isn't that strange?

06:38.510 --> 06:40.110
Speaking of strange, your face...

06:40.110 --> 06:42.280
That's got nothing to do with this either!

06:42.280 --> 06:45.450
It's too weird for her to go somewhere unannounced so early in the morning!

06:45.450 --> 06:47.250
She's probably hanging out with the wrong crowd!

06:47.250 --> 06:49.720
You're thinking too much. You'd better go to...

06:51.220 --> 06:54.020
Hayate, why don't you take a break and have a sip of coffee?

06:54.630 --> 06:55.420
What?

06:57.460 --> 06:58.490
Himeno!

06:59.760 --> 07:04.460
Himeno, I'm going to show you how powerless and burdensome you are.

07:06.200 --> 07:07.170
Could she have...

07:12.780 --> 07:15.080
Say, still can't find the demon larvae yet?

07:15.080 --> 07:16.210
They'll come out.

07:16.210 --> 07:17.780
Shut up! You're distracting my concentration.

07:17.780 --> 07:20.420
I wonder if Himeno's all right?

07:20.420 --> 07:22.420
She won't quit being the Prétear, will she?

07:22.420 --> 07:24.820
If she can't prét, she's not a Prétear.

07:25.360 --> 07:26.260
Kei!

07:26.260 --> 07:28.060
But there's no one to take her place.

07:28.060 --> 07:30.360
We'll have to count on Himeno to recover.

07:30.360 --> 07:34.260
If she doesn't, then it's over. This world, us...

07:41.370 --> 07:42.770
No!

07:53.650 --> 07:55.850
Everyone's alive.

07:55.850 --> 07:59.020
If I can't stop the Princess of Disaster...

08:01.460 --> 08:02.590
But...

08:03.230 --> 08:04.530
I...

08:09.400 --> 08:12.270
Is Sasame okay? Let us see him! Even if it's just his voice...

08:27.750 --> 08:28.580
Look out!

08:29.150 --> 08:29.710
Himeno!

08:33.760 --> 08:34.830
Hayate?

08:34.830 --> 08:35.760
Himeno?

08:35.760 --> 08:37.830
You're Hayate, right?

08:37.830 --> 08:39.360
You're Himeno's...

08:39.360 --> 08:42.070
Himeno didn't come to school today.

08:42.070 --> 08:45.040
Could it be because of you?

08:45.970 --> 08:48.170
Oh, that's right! Love is blind!

08:48.170 --> 08:49.770
The great stalker plan of love!

08:49.770 --> 08:52.710
I chase you, you run away, but the feelings are too strong!

08:52.710 --> 08:54.480
At times, that's too heavy a burden!

08:54.480 --> 08:57.140
That's why it's natural to want to run away!

08:57.680 --> 08:58.880
That may be it.

08:58.880 --> 08:59.950
Of course it is.

08:59.950 --> 09:02.750
But Himeno and the sailor she met at the seaport have gone to England.

09:02.750 --> 09:05.260
There, she has her fated encounter with her prince at a party.

09:05.260 --> 09:08.020
If I had it together a little more...

09:09.560 --> 09:11.960
I'm sorry. I was dazed.

09:12.760 --> 09:16.290
If you hadn't said something, it would have been an accident.

09:20.570 --> 09:23.230
About Sasame...

09:23.980 --> 09:25.840
Oh, sorry. What?

09:26.910 --> 09:28.280
Nothing.

09:29.750 --> 09:31.320
Where are you going?

09:31.320 --> 09:34.020
Nowhere. I don't have any destination.

09:34.020 --> 09:36.380
Then, it's the same as me.

09:42.460 --> 09:44.930
This is the first time I've taken a streetcar.

09:44.930 --> 09:46.660
Me too.

09:46.660 --> 09:49.030
I wonder where everyone's going?

09:49.800 --> 09:52.800
Say, what do I seem to be like?

09:52.800 --> 09:54.370
How? Well...

09:54.370 --> 09:57.110
You get good grades, you're pretty,

09:57.110 --> 10:01.870
...you have a great figure, you learn many things, you can do anything.

10:03.050 --> 10:04.350
But...

10:04.350 --> 10:08.310
It feels like I've never seen you laugh.

10:10.460 --> 10:12.160
Sorry for saying something weird.

10:12.160 --> 10:14.620
You're always laughing, aren't you?

10:15.660 --> 10:17.180
Really?

10:18.060 --> 10:20.160
There are times I can't laugh though.

10:32.480 --> 10:36.040
We can't wait for Kei. We'll look for the demon larvae ourselves!

10:45.460 --> 10:46.320
Himeno!

10:55.200 --> 10:56.270
Yes?

10:56.270 --> 10:58.370
Oops, sorry.

10:58.370 --> 10:59.900
Oh, I don't mind at all.

10:59.900 --> 11:01.570
Hey, what the hell?!

11:01.570 --> 11:05.580
Don't think a simple sorry is going to settle this.

11:05.580 --> 11:07.350
But what a wonderful world that would be.

11:07.350 --> 11:09.810
Himeno? You mean Himeno Awayuki?

11:09.810 --> 11:11.850
If you know her, tell...

11:11.850 --> 11:15.650
I think she was headed in the direction of the beach just now.

11:16.020 --> 11:17.020
How's Sasame?

11:17.020 --> 11:19.860
He's finally in stable condition. How about you?

11:19.860 --> 11:21.720
Can't get any leads at all.

11:26.760 --> 11:28.390
A dead end?

11:28.870 --> 11:30.400
It's over.

11:30.400 --> 11:33.930
This is about as far as we can go.

11:35.510 --> 11:36.740
There's still something up ahead.

11:36.740 --> 11:37.710
Ahead?

11:37.710 --> 11:38.380
Let's go!

11:38.380 --> 11:39.340
Hey, wait!

11:44.650 --> 11:45.950
See?

11:45.950 --> 11:47.550
It's not that much different.

11:47.550 --> 11:49.050
Sure it is.

11:49.050 --> 11:52.720
This is closer to the ocean. We can even go closer.

11:57.560 --> 11:58.720
It can't be!

12:01.670 --> 12:02.830
Are you all right?

12:03.670 --> 12:04.970
That surprised me.

12:04.970 --> 12:06.870
I was the one who was surprised!

12:06.870 --> 12:08.270
Oh, is that so?

12:10.940 --> 12:12.240
What a weird person.

12:16.050 --> 12:17.350
Aren't you cold?

12:17.350 --> 12:18.410
I'm okay.

12:19.650 --> 12:20.550
Sorry.

12:20.550 --> 12:21.620
What for?

12:21.620 --> 12:23.750
I'm always like this.

12:23.750 --> 12:28.720
I cause a lot of trouble for everyone, and I can't be of help to anyone.

12:29.560 --> 12:31.120
I'm pathetic.

12:32.260 --> 12:35.070
It would be great if you could live alone by yourself.

12:35.070 --> 12:36.300
Alone?

12:36.300 --> 12:41.830
If you are alone, you can't hurt anyone, nor will you get hurt.

12:43.340 --> 12:44.740
I guess so.

12:45.510 --> 12:46.640
What is it?

12:46.640 --> 12:48.810
I thought you'd disagree with me.

12:49.950 --> 12:52.010
Well, maybe I would have before.

12:52.850 --> 12:58.120
Well, but I had a lot of fun going to places with you today.

12:58.120 --> 13:01.360
I'm glad you were there with me.

13:01.360 --> 13:02.690
What a weird person.

13:03.690 --> 13:06.200
You have such a beautiful smile!

13:06.200 --> 13:08.430
You're weird for always hiding it.

13:09.170 --> 13:10.460
Are we just a bunch of weirdos?

13:12.100 --> 13:14.200
I'll go buy something to drink.

13:34.860 --> 13:37.760
What Mawata said may be right.

13:37.760 --> 13:41.160
Since I can't do anything, it may be best for me not to be around.

13:42.770 --> 13:47.030
Maybe it's better to look for another Prétear.

13:48.010 --> 13:52.340
That's why I should be alone, separate from everyone.

13:52.340 --> 13:53.670
From Hayate...

14:09.760 --> 14:13.000
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

14:09.760 --> 14:13.000
The boundless future stretches across the skies

14:13.000 --> 14:17.000
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

14:13.000 --> 14:17.000
And I am reborn anew

14:17.000 --> 14:24.370
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

14:17.000 --> 14:24.370
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

14:25.310 --> 14:26.780
I'm sorry!

14:33.720 --> 14:34.890
I...

14:34.890 --> 14:41.560
mizu ni yureru hanabira haruka tsuki o oikaketeku

14:34.890 --> 14:41.560
The flower petals swaying in the water chase after the distant moon

14:41.560 --> 14:45.860
miteta yume yori tooku e

14:41.560 --> 14:45.860
Going even farther than in my dreams

14:48.370 --> 14:55.310
iya na koto ga aru tabi hitori aoi sora o nagameru

14:48.370 --> 14:55.310
Whenever there's something I don't like, I gaze up at the blue skies

14:53.100 --> 14:54.610
I'm glad you're safe.

14:55.310 --> 15:00.310
yowai jibun ni maketakunai kara

14:55.310 --> 15:00.310
I don't want to give in to my weak parts

14:58.710 --> 15:01.550
I'm sorry I couldn't become Prétear,

15:01.550 --> 15:04.450
...for causing so much trouble for everyone.

15:02.010 --> 15:09.020
sagashiteita atatakai ai no basho mo mirai mo

15:02.010 --> 15:09.020
The warm loving place and the future I was searching for

15:04.450 --> 15:08.020
Please find another Prétear.

15:08.020 --> 15:09.890
I'm sorry.

15:09.020 --> 15:14.960
ki ga tsukeba mune no naka ni aru

15:09.020 --> 15:14.960
I suddenly realize they're inside my heart

15:09.890 --> 15:11.960
There's no need to apologize.

15:11.960 --> 15:16.160
Even if you can't become Prétear, you're still you.

15:14.960 --> 15:18.330
tatta hitotsu moshi dekiru koto ga

15:14.960 --> 15:18.330
If there's even one thing I can do

15:16.160 --> 15:18.330
There's no substitute.

15:18.330 --> 15:22.300
aru naraba mayowazuni kanaetai

15:18.330 --> 15:22.300
I want to do it without hesitating

15:20.870 --> 15:24.570
If it's this painful, then don't overtax yourself.

15:22.300 --> 15:28.610
te ni furete nemutteta watashi ima me o samasu

15:22.300 --> 15:28.610
Touch my hand, and I'll wake up from my sleep

15:25.570 --> 15:27.470
You can quit.

15:27.470 --> 15:28.610
Hayate...

15:28.610 --> 15:33.410
kokoro no naka hitori janai koto itai hodo

15:28.610 --> 15:33.410
Knowing that I'm not alone in my heart

15:33.410 --> 15:36.010
kono mune o atsuku suru

15:33.410 --> 15:36.010
Warms it so much that it hurts

15:36.010 --> 15:38.780
hajimaru ne shinjiru koto kara

15:36.010 --> 15:38.780
It all begins from the point of believing

15:38.780 --> 15:42.350
kono kimochi ikiru akashi

15:38.780 --> 15:42.350
These feelings are proof of being alive

15:42.350 --> 15:45.660
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

15:42.350 --> 15:45.660
The endless future and the expanding skies

15:44.260 --> 15:45.660
Mawata!

15:45.660 --> 15:49.560
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

15:45.660 --> 15:49.560
Allow me to be reborn anew...

15:49.560 --> 15:51.900
You're so nice, Hayate.

15:51.900 --> 15:53.360
Fenrir!

16:03.910 --> 16:07.110
Himeno, I brought a little present for you.

16:19.360 --> 16:23.760
If I drain a little more Leafe from them, they'll fade away.

16:23.760 --> 16:24.890
No...

16:28.230 --> 16:30.430
I'm so happy that you like it!

16:30.430 --> 16:32.240
Why?

16:35.670 --> 16:36.800
Himeno, run!

16:37.640 --> 16:41.700
You're going to protect a worthless woman who can't even become a Prétear, Hayate?!

17:00.160 --> 17:01.130
Hayate!

17:07.540 --> 17:10.200
Himeno, hurry and run.

17:11.940 --> 17:13.310
I don't understand!

17:14.040 --> 17:15.950
I don't understand at all!

17:15.950 --> 17:19.150
Takako, you loved Hayate, didn't you?

17:19.150 --> 17:21.590
So how can you do this?!

17:21.590 --> 17:24.460
Did you really love him?!

17:24.460 --> 17:27.960
Of course I did. I was willing to abandon everything for him.

17:27.960 --> 17:29.560
But even then...

17:29.560 --> 17:32.060
Himeno, you're the same.

17:32.060 --> 17:33.860
You'll be used as the Prétear,

17:33.860 --> 17:35.730
...and once business is taken care of, you'll be thrown away.

17:35.730 --> 17:38.940
You'll then become the Princess of Disaster, just like me.

17:38.940 --> 17:42.040
I won't become the Princess of Disaster!

17:42.040 --> 17:45.300
You're right. You can't even become a Prétear!

17:47.610 --> 17:48.770
Himeno...

17:49.850 --> 17:51.610
Hayate, I...

17:52.450 --> 17:55.050
I want to protect everyone again!

17:55.050 --> 17:57.150
I want the power to protect everyone!

17:59.660 --> 18:01.060
Stupid girl.

18:33.790 --> 18:34.820
What?!

18:39.860 --> 18:41.370
The Leafe is flowing out.

18:41.370 --> 18:42.460
Hey! That's...

18:47.540 --> 18:49.200
The White Prétear!

18:56.450 --> 18:58.280
That's the Wind Prétear!

18:58.280 --> 18:59.650
Yeah, I guess.

19:00.850 --> 19:02.610
Wind Sword!

19:02.750 --> 19:04.950
How?! Did she become Prétear again?!

19:20.340 --> 19:21.100
There!

19:46.330 --> 19:48.230
Himeno...

19:48.230 --> 19:50.430
For wounding me...

19:50.430 --> 19:52.800
You'll definitely pay for this!

19:52.800 --> 19:53.790
I swear it!

20:07.890 --> 20:09.720
Can you go on?

20:12.960 --> 20:14.250
Hayate...

20:14.860 --> 20:16.660
Thanks for coming.

20:23.930 --> 20:26.140
<i>Just how long are you two going to stare at one another?</i>

20:26.140 --> 20:28.610
<i>Oh, hey, don't get the wrong idea.</i>

20:28.610 --> 20:30.110
<i>That's right!</i>

20:30.110 --> 20:31.730
<i>Aren't you blushing?</i>

20:32.340 --> 20:33.340
<i>She really is.</i>

20:33.340 --> 20:34.680
<i>She's turned red!</i>

20:34.680 --> 20:37.310
<i>It's, well, because of the sunset!</i>

20:37.750 --> 20:39.240
<i>It pisses me off for some reason.</i>

20:41.950 --> 20:44.960
<i>Good, Mawata came home earlier.</i>

20:44.960 --> 20:47.860
<i>There's nothing good! You were out very late.</i>

20:47.860 --> 20:50.790
<i>We were worried, Himeno!</i>

20:50.790 --> 20:53.790
<i>Don't glomp me! Your scrubby chin hurts!</i>

20:54.930 --> 20:56.730
<i>That's awful, Himeno.</i>

20:56.730 --> 20:59.240
<i>When you go out, make sure to give word!</i>

20:59.240 --> 21:01.040
<i>Otherwise, my plans will be ruined!</i>

21:01.040 --> 21:03.170
<i>What plans would those be?</i>

21:08.710 --> 21:09.910
Who is it?

21:15.550 --> 21:18.920
Welcome home, Miss Mawata.

21:23.330 --> 21:29.030
Staring out the window of a room with the lights off

21:23.330 --> 21:29.030
akari o keshita heya no mado kara miru

21:29.030 --> 21:33.270
The stars shine in the night sky

21:29.030 --> 21:33.270
yozora ni hoshi ga hikaru

21:33.270 --> 21:39.140
